                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Birth of Eco Man"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f2576e86ebc38a5f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Setting"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Rainy night, Exterior, outskirts of Dovebrook"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-84efa710b52ce6ff"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Characters"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Law Enforcement Mechatron (Pre-Eco Man transformation)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Eco Man"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Polluting Company Bodyguards"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-abbb00ff348fefa9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Script"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The mechatron lies battered on the ground, surrounded by bodyguards wielding clubs."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9283c7df31ef8a45"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mechatron: Y—You dare attack an officer of the law!?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Bodyguard: Doesn't matter who you are. This is what happens when you mess with our drainage. Still want to play the hero?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mechatron: Environmental... protection... is everyone's... responsibility."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Bodyguard: Oh, still acting tough? You'll pipe down once you're at the bottom of the Pigeon River!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8282a55d60889ef4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The bodyguard raises his club to deliver a lethal blow."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-47bde69f55e72665"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "???: Do you crave power?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mechatron: Who's there? Who's speaking?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "???: Go now. Take this manhole cover and become a hero."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3593989fb15c0409"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The mechatron transforms into Eco Man and rises, using the manhole cover to take down every bodyguard."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-68034a6d9bc149c5"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Bodyguard: Who... who ARE you?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Eco Man: Me? I'm just a beat cop who happens to care about nature."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6f7392ae9bb1e989"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Close-up on the manhole cover as the logo on it glows with a blinding light."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a015c3ee51badc60"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfc3ab3590c469d6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Investor Feedback"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I have ONE demand: make the logo on the manhole cover bigger. I want everyone to know Eco Man uses our brand!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-134c08342c361e2f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Screenwriter Reply"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Understood. Changing it now!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3559bce8844c97ad"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
